 a,b are 13,7 and a>b selects a=13, choice ③.","independentSolve":"4a+4b=80 gives a+b=20. a²+b²=218 gives ab=91. Then a,b are 13,7 and a>b selects a=13, choice ③.","verdict":"SOURCE_CONFIRMED_CORRECTION","changedFields":["solution"],"before":{"answer":"③","solution":"직선각과 맞꼭지각, 평행선의 동위각·엇각 및 삼각형의 내각의 합을 이용해 그림의 각을 차례로 계산한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ③이다.","questionPayloadSha256":"F90741E83571ABDF15E4326BB77F766F77460A3DED4D718690049DCC45C3D32D","answerSha256":"B15BE6CB71072B84F7E1E198CE023FC5BB8B1E625335904DDCF3CFFCD8B7312B","solutionSha256":"B4416F09D997E65CBA31327B33AD225020BD559571BDE33C037D4B9FD44ECAD2"},"after":{"answer":"③","solution":"두 정사각형에 사용한 철사의 길이를 더하면 $4a+4b=80$이므로 $a+b=20$이다. 넓이의 합이 $a^2+b^2=218$이므로 $(a+b)^2-2ab=218$, 즉 $400-2ab=218$에서 $ab=91$이다.\n따라서 $a,b$는 $t^2-20t+91=(t-13)(t-7)=0$의 두 근이다. $a>b$이므로 $a=13$, $b=7$이고 정답은 ③이다.","questionPayloadSha256":"17B4F30B79D8AB0987BBDBB39EADA0B54FA869345CCB635D89BE335142312D9F","answerSha256":"B15BE6CB71072B84F7E1E198CE023FC5BB8B1E625335904DDCF3CFFCD8B7312B","solutionSha256":"CBBDB8281A183FDB307BE2EE48488242BB1C7870D21FC6684F0AF3FAB6DEC0B3"},"unchangedQuestionFieldsExact":["id","level","category","originalCategory","standardCourse","standardUnitKey","standardUnit","standardUnitOrder","questionType","layoutTag","tags","wide","content","choices","answer","subUnitKey","subUnit","subUnitConfidence","subUnitClassificationDepth"],"newTargetedSemanticTuple":{"sourceFingerprint":"75980123db3eab960775c976732a9bda9bcabcfbafbf5fd56fd0155b7585eea4","contentHash":"2ed0b7da0fd12d268b3b262cc1d5b75b65d2757651a8d371f8edc20949541b38","solutionHash":"12ca6f619c0eebed13d10471e7737b60c878c15e71e4faf75c2c276b9152a6db","inputBundleSha":"e511e85c4303010a24ce2af17e043859a25256656224a891085f2ab4ce4c171c"},"sourceJs":{"path":"archive/exams/original/high/h1/1mid/26_팔마고_1학기_중간_고1_기출_c.js","beforeThisBatchRawSha256":"A02EECABF026EC881EBBD5F1FACE31D62CE8BB789463E34BFCF2D1E8D00ECEF3","afterRawSha256":"739449FBD5BECA0EA205619779FB247E3C98FBDEDC28D48B88C7