eighted powers collect to 4ω+5ω²−6=9ω−11. Thus a=-11,b=9,b−a=20, choice ⑤.","independentSolve":"ω³=-1, ω⁶=1, and ω²=ω−1 for non-real ω. The nine weighted powers collect to 4ω+5ω²−6=9ω−11. Thus a=-11,b=9,b−a=20, choice ⑤.","verdict":"SOURCE_CONFIRMED_CORRECTION","changedFields":["answer","solution"],"before":{"answer":"④","solution":"주어진 식을 정리하고 필요한 값을 대입한 뒤 등식 또는 부등식의 기본 성질에 따라 계산한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 ④이다.","questionPayloadSha256":"3E8B477D0A17C1D77C6EEFD8432B93B6C803610620267E7935FBE794FFD80241","answerSha256":"D41EA6521F53FB3DFA10CF72E2932F4405D9C999FA422CDC840D25D57E90DD34","solutionSha256":"B3222DC6274ACCE51321CFC048D9E791525BF9A504955426FE0EE8C56FBF7F00"},"after":{"answer":"⑤","solution":"$\\omega^3=-1$이고 $\\omega$는 허근이므로 $\\omega^3+1=(\\omega+1)(\\omega^2-\\omega+1)=0$에서 $\\omega^2=\\omega-1$이다. 또한 $\\omega^6=1$이다.\n주어진 아홉 항에서 $\\omega^3=-1$, $\\omega^4=-\\omega$, $\\omega^5=-\\omega^2$, $\\omega^6=1$, $\\omega^7=\\omega$, $\\omega^8=\\omega^2$, $\\omega^9=-1$을 대입하면 합은 $4\\omega+5\\omega^2-6$이다. 이를 정리하면 $4\\omega+5(\\omega-1)-6=9\\omega-11$이므로 $a=-11$, $b=9$이다. 따라서 $b-a=20$이고 정답은 ⑤이다.","questionPayloadSha256":"A1AC18597C1BD3C7980BD99BBC770B5483AFD476E03F9FEC770C4A0D6B5D3FED","answerSha256":"0BDEF091C479702584F065D3A3714F8A76F851B3F0CF10912F345A5DD930B0A8","solutionSha256":"1AE385985BB2E0C6EE02C84DB34657328D976EE8B6DF57FC301EF29F73FF4A59"},"unchangedQuestionFieldsExact":["id","level","category","originalCategory","standardCourse","standardUnitKey","standardUnit","standardUnitOrder","questionType","layoutTag","tags","wide","content","choices","subUnitKey","subUnit","subUnitConfidence","subUnitClassificationDepth"],"newTargetedSemanticTuple":{"sourceFingerprint":"03044e55944065360d7077238804122b0965408bcdb003f627e93ffc89d695d0","contentHash":"62ab26c08b70f1c620e1d1493710cca3814a186e586dd17cdc123ec7e9f89406","solutionHash":"6375a5377d9667a9291f103309a00ed25f0ce104937db471e67b2dca072181ae","inputBundleSha":"cf6fd53fc861085b03ba896480cad8b45512a3551836deaa3ce3c32d1e6