dered pairs are (4,1),(-1,-4); sums 5 and -5, so maximum 5.","independentSolve":"x=y+3, and x²+y²=17 gives y²+3y−4=(y+4)(y−1)=0. Ordered pairs are (4,1),(-1,-4); sums 5 and -5, so maximum 5.","verdict":"SOURCE_CONFIRMED_CORRECTION","changedFields":["solution"],"before":{"answer":"(1) ($4, 1$), ($-1, -4$) (2) 5","solution":"풀이: 주어진 식 또는 그래프에서 좌표의 부호와 변화 관계를 확인하고, 문제의 조건을 식으로 정리한다. 주어진 정답과 일치하는 결과는 (1) ($4, 1$), ($-1, -4$) (2) 5이다.","questionPayloadSha256":"2FEDB9359E10B4C7EF851E411E18B562DBCA4E8F5D69B588CA33D1367A8AE572","answerSha256":"C3D862D3EFEAF0292DA260B5ACD7C6E7E7A575E71E47D7F272A50C49934BF354","solutionSha256":"474EE8DE8338FCF1646589CE963CC9D78BEC77625897B143F483856C894435B7"},"after":{"answer":"(1) ($4, 1$), ($-1, -4$) (2) 5","solution":"$x-y=3$에서 $x=y+3$이다. 이를 $x^2+y^2=17$에 대입하면 $(y+3)^2+y^2=17$, 즉 $y^2+3y-4=(y+4)(y-1)=0$이다.\n따라서 $y=1$이면 $x=4$이고, $y=-4$이면 $x=-1$이다. (1) 가능한 $(\\alpha,\\beta)$는 $(4,1)$과 $(-1,-4)$이다. (2) 두 경우의 $\\alpha+\\beta$는 각각 $5$, $-5$이므로 최댓값은 $5$이다.","questionPayloadSha256":"309B985B6AF095CA0E9EA65E665ABAB97E79F8357C6ABE25A7D12E00490047B2","answerSha256":"C3D862D3EFEAF0292DA260B5ACD7C6E7E7A575E71E47D7F272A50C49934BF354","solutionSha256":"72A7B16DBB8D0E99EBF72F3DABD9B24AADF66A984A1FFB700D29D7122B0EF2AB"},"unchangedQuestionFieldsExact":["id","level","category","originalCategory","standardCourse","standardUnitKey","standardUnit","standardUnitOrder","questionType","layoutTag","tags","wide","content","choices","answer","subUnitKey","subUnit","subUnitConfidence","subUnitClassificationDepth"],"newTargetedSemanticTuple":{"sourceFingerprint":"f68107316fc00b6353baee98a0d2d1b04dc1ab50e2c2743433ce48514ecc55d4","contentHash":"ff52fb4e5a0a25215380506e806a0aa231a4f5ca63dc63e5aba9dc9f9e3dc0c6","solutionHash":"8c50df30d63e46c7405efb1c3b209615f35ba85c890513cb9739475acd49fec7","inputBundleSha":"1a1cca2ebeca76c70f1c0f456e399d7b8e87bee87c721104ba66cd800fbcd978"},"sourceJs":{"path":"archive/exams/original/high/h1/1mid/26_팔마고_1학기_중간_고1_기출_c.js","beforeThisBatc